block.txt:
“Institution” means a hospital for
the insane or reception house or other place of the State appointed under the
law of the State for the reception of the insane;

“Resident of Norfolk
Island” includes any person who is in Norfolk Island whether a
resident or not;

“The
Court” means the Court of Norfolk Island sitting in its full
jurisdiction;

consulting with specialists in mental or other
diseases concerning such person or resident and treating him;
and

burying such person or resident if he shall die
in an institution or while otherwise in the custody of the State in terms of
this Agreement;

entry.txt:
Represents the
number of days in the period during which the person was
maintained;
